        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Purchased. Registered File number 1989/1572.\nPassed down through the female line (usually the eldest daughter in each generation) from the maker to the vendor. \nPreviously on loan to the V&A since 1927. Part of Lady Gerahty Loan and Lewis Loan. Related papers include NF for Lady Gerahty, NF for Gillian Lewis, 86/713, 89/1572."@en ;
